			"side": "right"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "seira",
			"expression": "hmm",
			"string": "Huh? No? Then why? Did something happen after our... unconventional duet?",
			"key": "ydEnd21",
			"side": "left"
		},
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "...I got rid of everyone...I killed everyone.",
			"key": "ydEnd22",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "Temporarily, but I killed them...And I feel horrible about it...I feel like a monster",
			"key": "ydEnd23",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "I was so upset about the situation that... that I just did the first thing that came to mind...",
			"key": "ydEnd24",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
			"string": "So… I hurt people. I hurt Kaity. I killed her boyfriend, and she was very mad at me...",
			"key": "ydEnd25",
			"side": "right"
                },
		{
			"isCommand": false,
			"name": "manuel",
			"expression": "sad",
